msgstr "Відпустка ідда"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:239
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Is Eligible` is enabled in the *End of Service Benefit* "
"section of the *Payroll* tab on the :ref:`employee profile <payroll/oman/"
"payroll_localizations/om-payroll_tab>`, the employee is eligible to receive "
"end of service benefits. When they leave the company, they receive the "
"following two benefits:"
msgstr ""
"Якщо опцію :guilabel:`Має право` увімкнено в розділі *Вихідна допомога* "
"вкладки *Розрахунок зарплати* у :ref:`профілі працівника <payroll/oman/"
"payroll_localizations/om-payroll_tab>`, працівник має право на отримання "
"вихідної допомоги. У разі звільнення з компанії він отримує такі дві виплати:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:244
msgid ""
"*Unused annual leaves compensation*: The *Annual Leave Balance* is shown on "
"the employee record. This is based on the :guilabel:`Annual Leave Time-off "
"Type` defined in the **Payroll** app settings, and is calculated as the "
"total remaining, unexpired allocations for that specific leave type assigned "
"to the employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:249
msgid ""
"The balance represents the total remaining leave allocated to the employee, "
"but does **not** reflect the portion of leave days the employee earned up to "
"the current month. When calculating the value, the deserved leave balance is "
"determined based on the portion of the year worked. The benefit value is "
"then calculated by multiplying this deserved balance by the employee's daily "
"rate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:256
msgid ""
"An employee has 3 days of remaining allocation days. If their daily rate is "
"50 OMR, the benefit value is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:259
msgid ":math:`3 \\text{ days} \\times 50 \\text{ OMR} = 150 \\text{ OMR}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:262
msgid ""
"If the allocation was fully given at the beginning of the year, the "
"calculation is based on *deserved leaves*, which are defined by the period "
"of time the employee worked during the current year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:266
msgid ""
"For example, an employee who worked for 7 months deserves 2.5*7 = 17.5 days. "
"This is deducted from the number of remaining unused allocations to get the "
"number of days to be compensated. This value can either be positive or "
"negative."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:270
msgid ""
"*End of Service Benefit*: The calculation begins by determining the total "
"number of days the employee worked at the company, from their hiring date to "
"their last working day. The total service duration is calculated out of a "
"365-day year. The resulting period in years is then multiplied by the "
"employee's basic salary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:275
msgid ""
"\\text{Latest Basic} \\times \\left(\\frac{\\text{Number of Days}}"
"{365}\\right)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:282
msgid ""
"Provisions are the amounts computed by the employer for |EOS| benefit "
"payments made to the employee, or for remaining annual leaves compensation "
"when employees leave the company. It is computed on a monthly basis but does "
"**not** affect the employee's net wage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:286
msgid ""
"*End of service benefit provision*: This is computed by dividing the monthly "
"basic salary by 12:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:288
msgid "\\frac{\\text{Basic}}{12}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:292
msgid ""
"*Annual leave provision*: This is computed by dividing the gross salary by "
"30 to calculate the daily salary, then multiplying that by the number of "
"leave days (which is 30 in Oman), and dividing the result by 12."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:307
msgid ""
"Several sections within the **Payroll** app also install a salary structure, "
"structure type, and rules specific to Oman."
