"Ensure the :guilabel:`Company MOL Number`, :guilabel:`Salary "
"Payer`, :guilabel:`Salary Payer MOL Number`, and the :guilabel:`WPS "
"Disbursement Bank Account` fields :ref:`are configured <payroll/oman/"
"payroll_localizations/om_payroll>`."
msgstr ""
