#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:39
msgid ""
"Provides Saudi Arabia payroll basics, including salary structures (Basic/"
"Gross/Net)."
msgstr ""
"Надає основи зарплати Саудівської Аравії, включаючи структури зарплат "
"(Базова/Валова/Чиста)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:40
