msgstr ":guilabel:`employee`: об'єкт hr.employee"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:169
msgid ":guilabel:`version`: hr.version object"
msgstr ":guilabel:`version`: об'єкт hr.version"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:170
msgid ""
":guilabel:`result_rules`: A dict containing the rules amounts, quantities, "
"rates and totals (previously computed), where the key is the rule code, and "
